{"ID":"20250708124453-55vkn3e","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250708124453-55vkn3e","title":"CPPS1L9——算数运算符","type":"doc","updated":"20250708130653"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250708124453-y6hishs","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250708124453-y6hishs","updated":"20250708130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算数运算符"}]},{"ID":"20250708124726-o1ify4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708124726-o1ify4c","updated":"20250708130407"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算数运算符 是用于 数值类型变量计算的运算符，它的返回结果是数值"}]},{"ID":"20250708124734-k652uv8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250708124734-k652uv8","name":"=","updated":"20250708130350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"赋值符号 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"="},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250708124743-utechvf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708124743-utechvf","updated":"20250708130350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键知识点 :先看右侧 再看左侧 把右侧的值赋值给左侧的变量"}]},{"ID":"20250708124810-ahmwtc0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708124810-ahmwtc0","updated":"20250708125032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"std::string myName = \"MrTang\";\nint myAge = 18;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708124948-lomshim","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250708124948-lomshim","updated":"20250708125758"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"+"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250708125016-ebwpjwd","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125016-ebwpjwd","updated":"20250708125734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 用自己计算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint i = 10;\n//12\ni = i + 2;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c i \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 连续运算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\ni = 1 + 3 + 2 + 4 + i + i;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c i \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 初始化时就运算  先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint i2 = 1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + i;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c i2 \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708125508-f2zq0rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708125508-f2zq0rn","updated":"20250708125512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出："}]},{"ID":"20250708125512-90mlzh5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125512-90mlzh5","updated":"20250708125514"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"12\n34\n44\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708124954-z221si4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250708124954-z221si4","updated":"20250708125804"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"-"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250708125533-mem8w3t","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125533-mem8w3t","updated":"20250708125726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 用自己计算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint j = 1;\nj = j - 1;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c j \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 连续运算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nj = 1 - 1 - 9 - 8 - j;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c j \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 初始化时就运算  先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint j2 = 0 - 1 - 99 - j;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c j2 \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708125549-y2v8ud1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708125549-y2v8ud1","updated":"20250708125551"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出："}]},{"ID":"20250708125551-uzn5mhi","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125551-uzn5mhi","updated":"20250708125626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"0\n-17\n-83\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708124956-d59je9t","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250708124956-d59je9t","updated":"20250708125937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乘 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"*"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250708125628-k291x3x","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125628-k291x3x","updated":"20250708125718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 用自己计算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint c = 1;\nc = c * 10;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c c \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 连续运算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nc = 1 * 2 * 10 * c;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c c \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 初始化时就运算  先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint c2 = 1 * 2 * c;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c c2 \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708125919-9edga7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708125919-9edga7r","updated":"20250708125923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出："}]},{"ID":"20250708125924-xttvuqc","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125924-xttvuqc","updated":"20250708125937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"10\n200\n400\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708125011-3lp6ot7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125011-3lp6ot7","updated":"20250708130239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"除 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"/"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250708125938-rbiudg3","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20250708125938-rbiudg3","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20250708130239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20250708130007-mr12awi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130007-mr12awi","updated":"20250708130239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：赋值时，没有小数的数值默认的整数 是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"int"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 如果用来做除法运算 要注意 会丢失小数点后的小数\n如果你想用浮点数来存储，一定要在运算时要有浮点数的特征，例如数字字面量后边加 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"f"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 已指明这是浮点数"}]}]},{"ID":"20250708130014-exw2el5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708130014-exw2el5","updated":"20250708130051"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 用自己计算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint chu = 2;\nchu = 10 / chu;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c chu \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 注意：\n// 赋值时，没有小数的数值默认的整数 是int 如果用来做除法运算 要注意 会丢失小数点后的小数\n// 如果你想用浮点数来存储 一定是 在运算时要有浮点数的特征\nchu = 1 / 2;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c chu \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\nfloat f = 1 / 2.0f;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c f \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708125930-qxu47fw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708125930-qxu47fw","updated":"20250708125930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出："}]},{"ID":"20250708125930-tuhykq5","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708125930-tuhykq5","updated":"20250708125934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"5\n0\n0.5\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708130132-p6i1w9e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250708130132-p6i1w9e","updated":"20250708130419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取余 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"%"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20250708130141-j81ejt4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708130141-j81ejt4","updated":"20250708130248"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 用自己计算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nint qy = 4;\n// 4 / 3 得到的余数是 1\nqy = qy % 3;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c qy \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n// 连续运算 先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\n// 1 % 2 = 1\nqy = 4 % 3 % 2;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c qy \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n// 初始化时就运算  先算右侧结果 再赋值给左侧变量\nqy = 1 % 2;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c qy \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708130246-ofqd6n6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130246-ofqd6n6","updated":"20250708130257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出："}]},{"ID":"20250708130258-owlkggy","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708130258-owlkggy","updated":"20250708130306"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"1\n1\n1\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708130418-2u1kmj1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20250708130418-2u1kmj1","updated":"20250708130653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"算数运算符的优先级"}]},{"ID":"20250708130431-f2s2bj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130431-f2s2bj0","updated":"20250708130445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优先级 是指 在混合运算时的运算顺序"}]},{"ID":"20250708130445-l9uyje1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250708130445-l9uyje1","updated":"20250708130509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250708130445-onyqd2y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250708130445-onyqd2y","updated":"20250708130509"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250708130445-bkzi9fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130445-bkzi9fn","updated":"20250708130509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"乘、除、取余"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 优先级高于 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"加、减"}]},{"ID":"20250708130449-6skpbut","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250708130449-6skpbut","updated":"20250708130449"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250708130446-loub4ie","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250708130446-loub4ie","updated":"20250708130446"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250708130446-xhqmkz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130446-xhqmkz9","updated":"20250708130446"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先算乘、除、取余"}]}]},{"ID":"20250708130447-vliyfzl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250708130447-vliyfzl","updated":"20250708130447"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250708130447-rovmzas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130447-rovmzas","updated":"20250708130447"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"后算加、减"}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250708130512-t7sa6ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130512-t7sa6ue","updated":"20250708130536"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"括号可以改变优先级 优先计算括号内内容，多组括号 先算最里层括号 依次往外算"}]},{"ID":"20250708130536-ufpzi5v","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708130536-ufpzi5v","updated":"20250708130653"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"//1 + 3 + 1 + 6 = 11\nint a = 1 + 2 * 3 / 2 + 1 + 2 * 3;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c a \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n// 1 + 0 + 1 + 6 = 8\na = 1 + 4 % 2 * 3 / 2 + 1 + 2 * 3;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c a \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n//括号可以改变优先级 优先计算括号内内容\n// 1 + 4 % 3 + 1 + 6 = 1 + 1 + 7\na = 1 + 4 % (2 * 3 / 2) + 1 + 2 * 3;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c a \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n\n//多组括号 先算最里层括号 依次往外算\n// 1 + 4 % ( 2 * 1) + 1 + 6 = 1 + 4 % 2 + 7 = 1 + 0 + 7 = 8\na = 1 + 4 % (2 * (3 / 2)) + 1 + 2 * 3;\nstd::cout \u003c\u003c a \u003c\u003c std::endl;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20250708130628-q6niy8l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250708130628-q6niy8l","updated":"20250708130636"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输出："}]},{"ID":"20250708130637-20vz3ly","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20250708130637-20vz3ly","updated":"20250708130638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"Y3Bw"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"11\n8\n9\n8\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}